title: XenServer / XCP-ng: Certificates
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors the expiry of the TLS certificates known to XAPI (host
 certificate, internal host certificate, CA certificates). Default levels are
 30/14 days remaining, {CRIT} when expired. Data comes from the special agent
 {agent_xenserver}.

discovery:
 One service per certificate with an expiry date. The item is the certificate type and name.
